/*  Pokemon FRLG Autostory
 *
 *  From: https://github.com/PokemonAutomation/
 *
 *  The story is split into segments that start where the previous one
 *  saved. Steps of a segment: walk a generated leg, talk, cutscene,
 *  battle, heal, save, grind, teach an HM, ... (see AutoStoryScript.h).
 *
 *  When a step fails, the game is soft reset to the last save and the
 *  story continues from the step after that save.
 *
 *  Routes are generated by SerialPrograms/Scripts/PokemonFRLG/AutoStory/
 *  (story_spec.py: the story, readable) from the pret/pokefirered
 *  map data: collision, elevation, ledges, warps, NPCs, trainer sight lines
 *  and script triggers. Runs over wild-encounter tiles are walked one step
 *  at a time, so the program always knows where a battle started.
 *
 */

